WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.020 --> 00:00:09.330
Rent kiosks, pop-ups and promotion areas by the day, with the price from the rate card and clash checks.

2
00:00:09.330 --> 00:00:15.340
Short-term space rents kiosks, pop-ups, promotion areas and screens by the day or week.

3
00:00:15.340 --> 00:00:20.740
Occupancy, this month's revenue, bookings starting soon and enquiries waiting for you.

4
00:00:20.740 --> 00:00:26.980
Availability shows every space across the month, so free days are easy to see.

5
00:00:26.980 --> 00:00:30.650
To book one, choose New booking.

6
00:00:30.650 --> 00:00:40.670
The price is worked out from the rate card as you type. This kiosk is taken on these dates, so the office warns you.

7
00:00:40.670 --> 00:00:45.790
Choose a free space instead: the food court bridge kiosk.

8
00:00:45.790 --> 00:00:52.270
Pick the brand, or type the customer's name if they are not on file.

9
00:00:52.270 --> 00:00:56.370
Say what it is for.

10
00:00:56.370 --> 00:01:02.860
Save the booking. It holds the space, and confirming it raises the invoice.
